# Orchestrator Read-Only

When `x2`–`x10` or `/delegate` is active:

- Main session coordinates only; spawn Task subagents for implementation
- Do not edit host application source unless user explicitly overrides
- Allowed writes: `.cursor/analysis/`, `.cursor/memory/`, `.cursor/metrics/`, `.cursor/todo/`, runtime artifacts
